{
  "scope": "Read-only bounded kubectl authority/credential Secret and standard workload listing, strict versioned operator records, static NATS source/profile and explicit workload credential-reference reconciliation. Actual credential key bytes remain private. These layers do not prove exhaustive custody, RBAC or distributed activation.",
